1. NSW Health Statewide Referral Criteria

   The list of information to include in a referral, and the triage
   categories, for adult chest pain reproduced in
   referral-completeness-demo.html are taken from:

     NSW Health, "Chest pain, discomfort and/or tightness in adult patients",
     Statewide Referral Criteria for NSW public outpatient services,
     current as at 10 September 2026.
     https://www.health.nsw.gov.au/outpatients/referrals/Pages/chest-pain-tightness-adult.aspx

   © State of New South Wales NSW Ministry of Health. For current information
   go to www.health.nsw.gov.au.

